{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Sally and the Job Inquiry"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The E-mail Request"}, {"type": "position", "content": 2}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 15}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Exchange advice and suggestions in communicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Requesting and Offering Help by E-mail"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you contact someone asking for help by e-mail, it is important to be very polite. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some common sentences and expressions that are considered polite in an e-mail."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Help\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Offering Help\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I'm not sure ... <br/><br/>Do you think you could ... ?<br/><br/>Could you tell me ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Don't you think ... ?<br/><br/>I think it would be a good idea to ... <br/><br/>Here are some tips ... \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some very polite sentences to include in your e-mail:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "I am a great admirer of your work.<br/>Any advice you can offer would be greatly appreciated! <br/>I look forward to your response!"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I'm not sure what steps to take next. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you think you could point me in the right direction?  "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Questions within Sentences"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You ask for clarification when you want more details of what the other person is talking about. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "We often ask for clarification when we are not clear on what the other person is referring to. We ask the other person to be more specific by giving more information. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use questions with sentences to ask for clarification. You ask a question including a sentence within the question, like <span class=\"italic\">Don't you think it sounds a bit too intense?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Questions with sentences are called <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions.</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use <span class=\"strong\">embedded questions</span>, like <span class=\"italic\">Can you tell me ... ?</span> or <span class=\"italic\">Do you know if/which/what ... ?</span> to ask for clarification.<br/>Look at the chart below for an explanation on how to make embedded questions."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Main Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Embedded Question</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you know ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you help me understand ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Can you explain to me ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Could you tell me ... \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"what/where/when/who ... ?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could you tell me what the best programs in journalism are? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Can you help me understand where I could get some experience?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "admirer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who admires, who appreciates something or someone"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am a great admirer of your columns in Cambridge Life. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le15ob02aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you write an e-mail asking for help."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pursue"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to follow (an idea, a career, etc.)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am very interested in pursuing a career in journalism."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le15ob02aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "videoconference"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "oral and visual communication using multimedia equipment such as computers"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Perhaps we could have a videoconference."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le15ob02aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "chat"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an informal discussion between two or more people, in person or using electronic methods"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We could have a Skype chat."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le15ob02aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "I look forward to your response"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a common ending to an e-mail asking for help"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Any advice you can offer would be greatly appreciated! I look forward to your response!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le15ob02aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le15ob02re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of 6 - 8 methods of communication (online and traditio